  "rounds": {
    "1": {
      "note": "Two ways to compare. (1) A 比 (bei2) B + adjective: 我比你高 (ngo5 bei2 nei5 gou1) = “I’m taller than you”. (2) A + adjective + 過 (gwo3) B: 我高過你 (ngo5 gou1 gwo3 nei5) — same meaning, very common in speech. Add 啲 (di1) for “a bit more” (高啲 gou1 di1 = taller), 最 (zeoi3) for “the most” (最高 zeoi3 gou1 = tallest), and 同…一樣 (tung4…jat1 joeng6) for “the same as”.",
      "words": [
        {
          "id": "comparisons-001",
          "c": "比",
          "j": "bei2",
          "e": "Than (compared to)"
        },
        {
